e1543]: Configure your site's basic information and display preferences.\n          - generic [ref=f1e1544]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e1545]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e1548]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e1549]: Site Identity\n                - generic [ref=f1e1550]: Your site's name and tagline.\n              - group \"Site Identity\" [ref=f1e1554]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e1555]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1557]:\n                    - text: Site Title\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e1558]: \"*\"\n                  - textbox \"Site Title\" [active] [ref=f1e1563]:\n                    - /placeholder: My Site\n                    - text: Northstar Shop — Staging\n                - generic [ref=f1e1564]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1565]: Tagline\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1567]:\n                    - textbox \"Tagline\" [ref=f1e1571]:\n                      - /placeholder: Just another ConvexPress site\n                      - text: Just another ConvexPress site\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e1572]: In a few words, explain what this site is about.\n            - generic [ref=f1e1573]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e1576]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e1577]: Site Address\n                - generic [ref=f1e1578]: The URLs where your site is accessible.\n              - group \"Site Address\" [ref=f1e1582]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e1583]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1585]:\n                    - text: Site Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e1586]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1587]:\n                    - textbox \"Site Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e1591]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e1592]: The URL where ConvexPress's core files reside.\n                - generic [ref=f1e1593]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1595]:\n                    - text: Home Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e1596]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1597]:\n                    - textbox \"Home Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e1601]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e1602]: The address visitors use to reach your site.\n                - note [ref=f1e1603]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1606]: These URLs should only be changed if you know what you're doing. In most cases, the Site Address and Home Address should be the same.\n            - generic [ref=f1e1607]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e1608]: Administration\n              - group \"Administration\" [ref=f1e1615]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e1616]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1618]:\n                    - text: Administration Email\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e1619]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1620]:\n                    - textbox \"Administration Email\" [ref=f1e1624]:\n                      - /placeholder: admin@example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e1625]: This address is used for admin purposes.\n                - generic [ref=f1e1626]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1627]: Membership\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1632] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e1633]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e1634]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e1635]:\n                      - text: Anyone can register\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e1636]: Allow public user registration on the site.\n                - generic [ref=f1e1637]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1638]: When Public Registration Is Off\n                  - generic [ref=f1e1642]:\n                    - radiogroup \"registrationMode\" [ref=f1e1643]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e1644] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e1645]:\n            