ttings\" [level=1] [ref=f1e2320]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e2321]: Configure your site's basic information and display preferences.\n          - generic [ref=f1e2322]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e2323]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e2326]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2327]: Site Identity\n                - generic [ref=f1e2328]: Your site's name and tagline.\n              - group \"Site Identity\" [ref=f1e2332]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2333]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2335]:\n                    - text: Site Title\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2336]: \"*\"\n                  - textbox \"Site Title\" [ref=f1e2341]:\n                    - /placeholder: My Site\n                    - text: My Site\n                - generic [ref=f1e2342]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2343]: Tagline\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2345]:\n                    - textbox \"Tagline\" [ref=f1e2349]:\n                      - /placeholder: Just another ConvexPress site\n                      - text: Just another ConvexPress site\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e2350]: In a few words, explain what this site is about.\n            - generic [ref=f1e2351]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e2354]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2355]: Site Address\n                - generic [ref=f1e2356]: The URLs where your site is accessible.\n              - group \"Site Address\" [ref=f1e2360]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2361]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2363]:\n                    - text: Site Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2364]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2365]:\n                    - textbox \"Site Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e2369]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e2370]: The URL where ConvexPress's core files reside.\n                - generic [ref=f1e2371]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2373]:\n                    - text: Home Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2374]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2375]:\n                    - textbox \"Home Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e2379]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e2380]: The address visitors use to reach your site.\n                - note [ref=f1e2381]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2384]: These URLs should only be changed if you know what you're doing. In most cases, the Site Address and Home Address should be the same.\n            - generic [ref=f1e2385]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e2386]: Administration\n              - group \"Administration\" [ref=f1e2393]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2394]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2396]:\n                    - text: Administration Email\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2397]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2398]:\n                    - textbox \"Administration Email\" [ref=f1e2402]:\n                      - /placeholder: admin@example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e2403]: This address is used for admin purposes.\n                - generic [ref=f1e2404]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2405]: Membership\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2410] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e2411]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2412]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e2413]:\n                      - text: Anyone can register\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e2414]: Allow public user registration on the site.\n                - generic [ref=f1e2415]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2416]: When Public Registration Is Off\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2420]:\n                    - radiogroup \"registrationMode\" [ref=f1e2421]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e2422] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e2423]:\n                          - radio [checked] [ref=f1e2424]\n                          - radio [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2426]\n                        - generic [ref=f1e2427]: Invite-only\n                      - generic [ref=f1e2429] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e2430]:\n                          - radio [ref=f1e2431]\n                          - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2432]\n                        - generic [ref=f1e2433]: Closed\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2435]: invite_only\n                - generic [ref=f1e2436]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2437]: New User Default Role\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2441]:\n                    - combobox \"New User Default Role\" [ref=f1e2442]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e2443]: subscriber\n                      - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2444]: ▼\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2446]: subscriber\n            - generic [ref=f1e2447]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e2450]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2451]: Password Notifications\n                - generic [ref=f1e2452]: Control email notifications related to password resets and changes.\n              - group \"Password Notifications\" [ref=f1e2456]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2457]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2458]: Password Reset Request\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2463] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e2464]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2465]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e2466]:\n                      - text: Send a branded reset email\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e2467]: Send a ConvexPress-branded password reset email in addition to the default authentication provider email.\n                - generic [ref=f1e2468]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2469]: Password Changed Confirmation\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2474] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [checked] [ref=f1e2475]\n                    - checkbox [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2479]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e2480]:\n                      - text: Send confirmation when password changes\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e2481]: Notify the user via email when their password has been successfully changed.\n                - generic [ref=f1e2482]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2483]: Admin Notification\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2488] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e2489]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2490]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e2491]:\n                      - text: Notify administrator on password reset\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e2492]: Send an email to the administration email address whenever any user resets their password.\n            - generic [ref=f1e2493]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e2496]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2497]: Locale\n                - generic [ref=f1e2498]: Language, timezone, and date/time display settings.\n              - group \"Locale\" [ref=f1e2502]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e2503]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2504]: Site Language\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2508]:\n                    - combobox \"Site Language\" [ref=f1e2509]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e2510]: en-US\n                      - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2511]: ▼\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e2513]: en-US\n                - generic [ref=f1e2514]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2515]: Timezone\n                  - button \"America/New_York (Eastern)\" [ref=f1e2520]\n                - generic [ref=f1e2525]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2526]: Date Format\n                  - generic [ref=f1e2530]:\n                    - radiogroup \"dateFormat\" [ref=f1e2531]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e2532]