         - heading \"General Settings\" [level=1] [ref=f1e3102]\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e3103]: Configure your site's basic information and display preferences.\n          - generic [ref=f1e3104]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e3105]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e3108]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3109]: Site Identity\n                - generic [ref=f1e3110]: Your site's name and tagline.\n              - group \"Site Identity\" [ref=f1e3114]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3115]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3117]:\n                    - text: Site Title\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3118]: \"*\"\n                  - textbox \"Site Title\" [ref=f1e3123]:\n                    - /placeholder: My Site\n                    - text: Northstar Shop — Staging\n                - generic [ref=f1e3124]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3125]: Tagline\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3127]:\n                    - textbox \"Tagline\" [ref=f1e3131]:\n                      - /placeholder: Just another ConvexPress site\n                      - text: Just another ConvexPress site\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e3132]: In a few words, explain what this site is about.\n            - generic [ref=f1e3133]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e3136]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3137]: Site Address\n                - generic [ref=f1e3138]: The URLs where your site is accessible.\n              - group \"Site Address\" [ref=f1e3142]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3143]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3145]:\n                    - text: Site Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3146]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3147]:\n                    - textbox \"Site Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e3151]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e3152]: The URL where ConvexPress's core files reside.\n                - generic [ref=f1e3153]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3155]:\n                    - text: Home Address (URL)\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3156]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3157]:\n                    - textbox \"Home Address (URL)\" [ref=f1e3161]:\n                      - /placeholder: https://example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e3162]: The address visitors use to reach your site.\n                - note [ref=f1e3163]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3166]: These URLs should only be changed if you know what you're doing. In most cases, the Site Address and Home Address should be the same.\n            - generic [ref=f1e3167]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e3168]: Administration\n              - group \"Administration\" [ref=f1e3175]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3176]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3178]:\n                    - text: Administration Email\n                    - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3179]: \"*\"\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3180]:\n                    - textbox \"Administration Email\" [ref=f1e3184]:\n                      - /placeholder: admin@example.com\n                    - paragraph [ref=f1e3185]: This address is used for admin purposes.\n                - generic [ref=f1e3186]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3187]: Membership\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3192] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e3193]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3194]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e3195]:\n                      - text: Anyone can register\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e3196]: Allow public user registration on the site.\n                - generic [ref=f1e3197]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3198]: When Public Registration Is Off\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3202]:\n                    - radiogroup \"registrationMode\" [ref=f1e3203]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e3204] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e3205]:\n                          - radio [checked] [ref=f1e3206]\n                          - radio [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3208]\n                        - generic [ref=f1e3209]: Invite-only\n                      - generic [ref=f1e3211] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - generic [ref=f1e3212]:\n                          - radio [ref=f1e3213]\n                          - radio [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3214]\n                        - generic [ref=f1e3215]: Closed\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3217]: invite_only\n                - generic [ref=f1e3218]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3219]: New User Default Role\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3223]:\n                    - combobox \"New User Default Role\" [ref=f1e3224]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e3225]: subscriber\n                      - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3226]: ▼\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3228]: subscriber\n            - generic [ref=f1e3229]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e3232]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3233]: Password Notifications\n                - generic [ref=f1e3234]: Control email notifications related to password resets and changes.\n              - group \"Password Notifications\" [ref=f1e3238]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3239]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3240]: Password Reset Request\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3245] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e3246]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3247]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e3248]:\n                      - text: Send a branded reset email\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e3249]: Send a ConvexPress-branded password reset email in addition to the default authentication provider email.\n                - generic [ref=f1e3250]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3251]: Password Changed Confirmation\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3256] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [checked] [ref=f1e3257]\n                    - checkbox [checked] [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3261]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e3262]:\n                      - text: Send confirmation when password changes\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e3263]: Notify the user via email when their password has been successfully changed.\n                - generic [ref=f1e3264]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3265]: Admin Notification\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3270] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - checkbox [ref=f1e3271]\n                    - checkbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3272]\n                    - generic [ref=f1e3273]:\n                      - text: Notify administrator on password reset\n                      - paragraph [ref=f1e3274]: Send an email to the administration email address whenever any user resets their password.\n            - generic [ref=f1e3275]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e3278]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3279]: Locale\n                - generic [ref=f1e3280]: Language, timezone, and date/time display settings.\n              - group \"Locale\" [ref=f1e3284]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e3285]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3286]: Site Language\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3290]:\n                    - combobox \"Site Language\" [ref=f1e3291]:\n                      - generic [ref=f1e3292]: en-US\n                      - img [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3293]: ▼\n                    - textbox [aria-hidden] [ref=f1e3295]: en-US\n                - generic [ref=f1e3296]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3297]: Timezone\n                  - button \"America/New_York (Eastern)\" [ref=f1e3302]\n                - generic [ref=f1e3307]:\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3308]: Date Format\n                  - generic [ref=f1e3312]:\n                    - radiogroup \"dateFormat\" [ref=f1e3313]